{
  "name": "Generate AI captions and post to Instagram and Pinterest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate AI captions and post to Instagram and Pinterest\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the post topic that guide the AI-written content.\n3. Uses OpenAI to write the post copy and parses it into per-platform fields.\n4. Publishes posts to Instagram and Pinterest via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] In the Set post topic node, set the post topic to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Set your Pinterest board ID in the Publish to Pinterest node.\n- [ ] Replace the sample media URL with your own public image or video URL.\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the prompt in the AI Caption Generator node, or change the OpenAI model, to tune the tone of the copy.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 654
      },
